# Direct runtime dependencies of the indexer worker (ADR-0015); a subset of the backend's,
# kept at the backend's versions. Compile after backend.txt (server/README.md).
-c backend.txt
# Settings from environment variables only (ADR-0010) and the queue message schemas.
pydantic
pydantic-settings
# Structured JSON logs (ADR-0011).
structlog
# The key store: GET only, through its own ACL user (ADR-0015).
redis
# RabbitMQ: reads index.chunks, publishes index.vectors.
aio-pika
# AES-256-GCM, HKDF and key unwrapping; the standard library has no AEAD.
cryptography
# The embedder's HTTP client (Ollama).
httpx
# Metrics and traces (ADR-0011).
prometheus-client
opentelemetry-api
opentelemetry-sdk
opentelemetry-exporter-otlp-proto-http
